      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        126,
        1285,
        1048,
        1391
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(2) The Mayor shall annually designate the Chairman and Vice Chairman of the Council. In the event of a vacancy in the office of Chairman or Vice Chairman resulting from death or resignation, the Mayor shall designate a successor Chairman or Vice Chairman to fill such vacancy from a list of at least three members of the Council submitted by the Council to the Mayor for that purpose.",
